71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cZH5AEYdXCkQ7kNvwFWAqHA&_nc_oc=AdoA5umoSr-DluLdrL-w3VHkwGGktqHeVtDIAWlb_LMHyo5ZELoHIdI0d_kFIorO53A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8T7WYFZkS-bI0Tf_yKVJH2SDyO7KgeVn__3uE75ZZqnQ&oe=6A47B4B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hAQ1pB0gIBIQ7kNvwFaO6Sa&_nc_oc=Adpx1e4b88_9iOnyiVcVDFB92SR7I9jeMrwVxEhOq2xPx0wdI_ioWNp4MlojtA_9p5A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8378ZfdrouApcrV-8J0d_Z7-czjDLF8y9UbGhZRThyGQ&oe=6A47C793"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R2osYgmpC_gQ7kNvwHRS6Vq&_nc_oc=AdrF2ihZ0GXet-jgVmmVsY0HNK6LYRv-SkoAgD0C75txKBRRv4Y0-ETfpdGT8yKaQ9M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8U6Nfg2CPRUXOK6aOL6F1swZmdhwBsmdXh_cQA6LrhGw&oe=6A47C5DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: